        "type": "game",
        "name": "Another Day of My Life",
        "steam_appid": 3985920,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a puzzle game driven by a mystery story. The game is about a little girl's strange day. One morning, the girl is super excited to prepare a birthday gift for her mom. But then, she finds her mom has vanished out of the blue, and her dad, who's always been so kind, starts acting really weird. The girl wonders where her mom is and why her dad is acting so differently. She has to start the investigation on her own. And as she digs deeper, things get even more confusing...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Storyline:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Follow the girl around. You'll need to look closely, think carefully, and use your imagination to solve one puzzle after another. This way, you can figure out what different characters are thinking, understand the relationships between them, and finally find out what's really going on.</i> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Game Design:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(1) There are tons of different puzzle types made according to the story. They have different levels of difficulty and styles. They're easy to start with, but still challenging.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(2) As the story goes on, there are also some cool mini-games. Each mini-game has its own artistic style, giving you a really new and interesting experience.</i> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Hand-drawn Art Style:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(1) All the game sprites are hand-drawn by us.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(2) The art style is really unique and diverse, which give clues about the stories that happen to the characters and their emotional changes. This makes the puzzle game look really different and interesting.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a puzzle game driven by a mystery story. The game is about a little girl's strange day. One morning, the girl is super excited to prepare a birthday gift for her mom. But then, she finds her mom has vanished out of the blue, and her dad, who's always been so kind, starts acting really weird. The girl wonders where her mom is and why her dad is acting so differently. She has to start the investigation on her own. And as she digs deeper, things get even more confusing...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Storyline:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Follow the girl around. You'll need to look closely, think carefully, and use your imagination to solve one puzzle after another. This way, you can figure out what different characters are thinking, understand the relationships between them, and finally find out what's really going on.</i> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Game Design:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(1) There are tons of different puzzle types made according to the story. They have different levels of difficulty and styles. They're easy to start with, but still challenging.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(2) As the story goes on, there are also some cool mini-games. Each mini-game has its own artistic style, giving you a really new and interesting experience.</i> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Hand-drawn Art Style:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(1) All the game sprites are hand-drawn by us.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(2) The art style is really unique and diverse, which give clues about the stories that happen to the characters and their emotional changes. This makes the puzzle game look really different and interesting.</i></p>",
        "short_description": "In the game, the little girl has the strangest day of her life. It starts in a quite peaceful morning and ends up in a really weird night. Her mom is missing, and her dad is acting crazy... What happens this day seems all mixed up and strange, but it's actually meant to be.",
